# Line endings (2026-11-16). Blobs are LF; a Windows checkout gets LF too, so a script
# or SKILL.md does not turn dirty when autocrlf differs between clones.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binaries, never converted
*.exe binary
*.syso binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
